 "note": "The press-two-tabs latch, v7, on the Overseer pack (764.6 g with its cartridge). The same latch module as the Scout's: same slider, springs, 3 x 20 dowels and grabber blades. Cut at the tab line. The XT60 is 77.7 mm from the pull, so the two nubs carry 119.5 N (worst index 0.361). In the landing funnel: clear seated, landing and on the swap path; the cartridge passes the hole with 1.0 mm a side. Numbers under the viewer.",
